Inter-GPU Microbenchmarks will be run with the following:
# GPUs per NUMA: 1
# GPUs per socket: 1
# GPUs per node: 4
# Processes per GPU: 64
If these are incorrect, edit the defines at the top of benchmarks/microbenchmarks.cpp
